{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"温暖变得轻盈、快乐带上回望的酸楚及独处感，分别接在 H4、H5、H7、H11、H13 已确立的心理状态上，M1、M17、M21 只是把这些因果联系起来，没有新增事件或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“想劝自己算了，却还是舍不得”是由 H7、H11 的独自承受与留恋，以及 H12 的不确定中延伸出的局部心理拉扯，M24、M25 又为突然酸楚和温柔回归提供了依据，没有新增外部事件或改变仍然在意对方的主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"独自重温亲近及舒服与遗憾并存，可以由 H13、H11 和 M20 推出，而且明确指出不能据此断定具体的身体感觉或幻想，没有越界补写。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条都直接交代了感受及其心理成因，即使去掉听感记录，也能区分温柔回望、私密拉扯和独自回味这三种不同的情感过程。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6c5dae6f-3133-412b-b720-4dc24a6ea962", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T144008594552Z", "elapsed_seconds": 148.187, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:42:36.799838+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9e0334c6cf145cd84debda5ab8bc9777137d0165e111a360c5b566e5f1c72d5d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "